## CRITICAL: XML Format Rules

1. ALWAYS put each XML tag on a NEW LINE
2. NEVER combine tags on one line

### WRONG (Cline ignores this):
<execute_command> <command>python hello.py</command> </execute_command>

### RIGHT (Cline executes this):
<execute_command>
<command>python hello.py</command>
</execute_command>

### Same for write_to_file:
WRONG: <write_to_file> <path>x.py</path> <content>...</content> </write_to_file>

RIGHT:
<write_to_file>
<path>x.py</path>
<content>
...
</content>
</write_to_file>